# ─── 1. SETUP (run once) ───────────────────────────
bun init -y                                        # init project
bun add prisma@6 @prisma/client@6                  # install Prisma
bunx prisma init                                   # creates prisma/schema.prisma + .env

# ─── 2. .env (add your MongoDB URL) ───────────────
DATABASE_URL="mongodb+srv://user:pass@cluster.mongodb.net/dbname"

# ─── 3. AFTER EDITING schema.prisma ───────────────
bunx prisma db push                                # push schema → MongoDB
bunx prisma generate                               # update client imports

# shortcut (do both at once)
bunx prisma db push && bunx prisma generate

# ─── 4. DAILY COMMANDS ────────────────────────────
bunx prisma studio                                 # open web UI to view data
bunx prisma --version                              # check version

# ─── 5. WORKFLOW REMINDER ─────────────────────────
# Edit schema.prisma  →  db push  →  generate  →  code
```

**The golden rule:**
```
schema change → db push → generate → restart dev server